{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“Artin 对象”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Artin对象"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>在 "},{"Local":{"url":"Abel范畴","text":"Abel 范畴"}},{"Plain":"中, 满足子对象的降链条件的对象称为 Artin 对象. 例如, Artin 模就是指满足子模的降链条件的模.</p>\n<p>另见 "},{"Local":{"url":"Artin环","text":"Artin 环"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}